-- Level mode, phase 3: every level after Level 1. Run once via the
-- Supabase SQL editor (or `supabase db push`). Builds on 0020_level_prizes.
-- Generated by `npx tsx scripts/buildLevels.ts --sql 2-28`. Level 1's
-- questions and its goal_horn prize are already in 0019 and 0020.
-- Prizes mirror levelPrize in src/game/levels/rewards.ts: odd levels a shop
-- item, even levels a 50-coin chest.

on conflict (question_id) do nothing;

on conflict (level) do nothing;
